Task: migrate the `apps/linux` data plane onto `relayable_client::Client`
(`next_output` + `resize_with_pixels`), two-plane split kept.

Host: Linux `falcon` x86_64; single monitor 1920x1080 @ scale 1.
Worktree: `/home/sulthonuladib/work/relayable-wt/ui-003` (branch `ui/ui-003-next-output`).

Harness: `/tmp/opencode/ui003-probe/accept.sh` — the commands below are exactly the
commands it ran; every line that follows is real output. The scratch server used
